   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT in relation to authorizing Daniel Montalto to take the competitive\ncivil service examination for the position of police officer and be placed on\nthe eligible list for employment as a full-time police officer for the town of\nShawangunk",
    "basePrintNo": "S8398",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S8398-2025",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "",
    "lawSection": "Civil Service",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S8398\n\nSPONSOR: OBERACKER\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act in relation to authorizing Daniel Montalto to take the compet-\nitive civil service examination for the position of police officer and\nbe placed on the eligible list for employment as a full-time police\nofficer for the town of Shawangunk\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nAuthorizes Daniel Montalto to take the competitive civil service exam\nand be placed on the eligible civil service list for employment as a\npolice officer in the town of Shawangunk\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1: Authorizes Daniel Montalto to take the civil service test and\nbe placed on the eligible list for the town of Shawangunk police depart-\nment\n\nSection 2: Daniel Montalto shall otherwise be subject to the merit and\nfitness requirements Section 3: Effective Date\n\n \nEXISTING LAW:\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nMr. Montalto along with the town of Shawangunk have requested this bill,\nso that the town can hire Mr. Montalto as a full-time police officer, as\nhe is currently working for the town part-time.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNone\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nThe salary of a police officer for the town.\n\n \nLOCAL FISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nThe salary of a police officer for the town.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nImmediately\n",
